When we run 'c2c new codex -- ' or something, that's useful for aliases. Great. But also it would be nice to be able to add c2c flags after this so they're usable with the alias. So for example, if cx='c2c new codex -- ', then 'cx --model gpt-5.6-sol' works as expected, but this would be even better: 'cx --model gpt-5.6-sol --c2c:name cx-custom-c2c-alias'
